{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/radisson-at-damac-hills","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":871,"crm_id":null,"search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Radisson at Damac Hills","slug":"radisson-at-damac-hills","display_address":"Damac Hills","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2020","developer":"Damac Properties","price":814000,"display_price":"814K","lattitude":25.12261515,"longitude":55.2751200855707,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Welcome to beautiful golf-course view hotel rooms and suites at Radisson Dubai in Damac Hills. Damac has joined hands with The Radisson Hotel Group for the beautiful and exciting project offering <strong>1 &amp; 2 bedroom</strong> <strong>suites</strong> within the 481-key hotel.</p><p>This hotel is located next to the Trump International Golf Club and is a great investment opportunity in the hospitality industry with high ROI expected. Offering not just a great place to live in, but also the best views of the green surroundings and amenities perfectly tailored to business and leisure travellers. The highest standards are maintained all up to code with the Radisson standards, including the best service and care. Located in Damac Hills, the hotel is close to Mall of Emirates and the beach, as well as Dubai Marina, Business Bay and the Dubai International Airport. The residents will have access to swimming pools, gymnasium, steam rooms, sauna and ample parking. Damac Hills, as a community, offers much more, including stables, the Park, themed gardens, sporting arenas, and skating parks</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/radisson_feature_aa53ccb512.jpg","hash":"radisson_feature_aa53ccb512","name":"Radisson at Damac Hills"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.